                      CURRICULUM VITAE (ACADEMIC PROFILE)
========================================================================
PROF. MICHAEL CHEN
Editorial Board Member, IST Online Journal
Professor, School of Computing, National University of Singapore (NUS)
Email: m.chen@nus.edu.sg / chen.michael@istjournal.ly
Research Profile: Cybersecurity, Cryptography & Blockchain Infrastructure
========================================================================

BIOGRAPHY:
Prof. Michael Chen is an internationally recognized expert in Cybersecurity and 
Distributed Systems security. His research encompasses advanced cryptographic protocols, 
blockchain validation, and network security threat modeling. He serves on the 
editorial board of several leading IEEE and ACM journals and contributes to the 
IST Online Journal’s cybersecurity and networking review panel.

EDUCATION:
- Ph.D. in Computer Science (Specialization in Information Security)
  Stanford University, USA (2005)
  Thesis: "Provably Secure Multi-Party Cryptographic Communication Protocols"
- M.S. in Computer Science
  Tsinghua University, Beijing, China (2000)
- B.S. in Computer Science
  Tsinghua University, Beijing, China (1998)

ACADEMIC APPOINTMENTS & ROLES:
- Professor of Computer Science
  National University of Singapore (2015 - Present)
- Associate Professor, School of Computing
  National University of Singapore (2009 - 2015)
- Assistant Professor of Cybersecurity
  Purdue University, USA (2005 - 2009)

